{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26295","headline":"题海榴树呈八叔大人 · 沈亚之","name":"题海榴树呈八叔大人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾在蓬壶伴衆仙，文章枝叶五云边。\n几时奉宴瑶台下，何日移荣玉砌前。\n染日裁霞深雨露，凌寒送暖占风烟。\n应笑强如河畔柳，逢波逐浪送张骞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈亚之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26295.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26295","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}